{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manga Ninja is an innovative platform jumping game. In this unique comic book world, you will play as a ninja and embark on a challenging adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike traditional jumping games, you cannot jump directly, but need to use your ninja skills skillfully. By launching shuriken, you can create grappling points in the air, and then quickly launch the grappling hook to the position of the shuriken to achieve thrilling displacement. This unique way of moving will bring you an unprecedented gaming experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Throwing darts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/c92c9eadbd7e2cebc7d3f6f520e0a417.poster.avif?t=1753250938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/c92c9eadbd7e2cebc7d3f6f520e0a417.webm?t=1753250938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/c92c9eadbd7e2cebc7d3f6f520e0a417.mp4?t=1753250938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Launch the grappling hook</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/d9b7530a48124eb84d8c439d7f78565f.poster.avif?t=1753250938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/d9b7530a48124eb84d8c439d7f78565f.webm?t=1753250938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/d9b7530a48124eb84d8c439d7f78565f.mp4?t=1753250938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will embark on an adventure in various scenes full of Japanese characteristics: ancient dojos, quiet bamboo forests, picturesque canals, and magnificent Japanese castles. Each scene has been carefully designed with a unique visual style, full of challenges and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3061370?t=1753250938","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/40eb403f3a2aae0539bb67bfbec4348886f9d0d9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753250938","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/57fd774acbd493ba0aa177142dd7f7a5f0c3c9dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753250938","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/57fd774acbd493ba0aa177142dd7f7a5f0c3c9dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753250938","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manga Ninja is an innovative platform jumping game. In this unique comic book world, you will play as a ninja and embark on a challenging adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike traditional jumping games, you cannot jump directly, but need to use your ninja skills skillfully. By launching shuriken, you can create grappling points in the air, and then quickly launch the grappling hook to the position of the shuriken to achieve thrilling displacement. This unique way of moving will bring you an unprecedented gaming experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Throwing darts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/c92c9eadbd7e2cebc7d3f6f520e0a417.poster.avif?t=1753250938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/c92c9eadbd7e2c